  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/fb3a8d2e-b733-41a6-896e-96f585e49e13-image.png\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 181px;\" /></p><p>This parallel plate capacitor can be divided into two capacitors. One with dielectric <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and other without dielectric<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced></math>. The two capacitors will be in series.</p><p>Initially&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;F</mi></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>k</mi><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>d</mi></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;F</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>A</mi></mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>d</mi></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;F</mi></math></p><p>Finally&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>C</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>24</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>24</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#956;F</mi></math></p>",
